  Copy for the moxie hub. Vercel’s project root is moxie/, so these files
  live at moxie/jaack-design-system/ (the repo gitignore ignores vendor/).
  Same zip sha as assets/jaack-design-system on the jaack.me site.
  screenshots/ are omitted here; they ship with the jaack.me copy.
  Do not edit jaack.css, jaack.js, theme.js or tokens.css by hand.
  theme.js loads as a blocking script in <head>. Demo content is placeholder only.
  The packaged gold accent is Forma's shared default. Moxie overrides accent,
  paper and gradient in jaack-moxie.css; do not treat the gold as this hub's accent.
  Narrow screens: the top bar and theme switch shrink (min-width: 0, flex-shrink)
  and each switch button is 36px below 760px. Same patch as the jaack.me copy.
